{"v":1,"book":"Exod","ch":11,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Then Jehovah said to Moses, One more plague will I bring upon Pharaoh and upon Egypt; after that he will let you go from here. When he lets you go, he will surely drive you out from here completely.","tok":[{"t":"Then "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"One","s":["H0259"],"a":[6]},{"t":" more "},{"t":"plague","s":["H5061"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will I "},{"t":"bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[7]},{"t":" upon "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and upon "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; after that he will let you "},{"t":"go","s":["H7971"],"a":[14]},{"t":" from here. When he lets you "},{"t":"go","s":["H7971"],"a":[17]},{"t":", he will "},{"t":"surely","s":["H1644"],"a":[19]},{"t":" drive you "},{"t":"out","s":["H1644"],"a":[20]},{"t":" from here completely."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Speak now in the hearing of the people that each man is to ask of his neighbor and each woman of her neighbor for articles of silver and articles of gold.","tok":[{"t":"Speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[0]},{"t":" now in the hearing of the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[3]},{"t":" that each "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is to ask of his neighbor and each "},{"t":"woman","s":["H0802"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of her neighbor for articles of "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[12]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"articles","s":["H3627"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And Jehovah gave the people favor in the sight of the Egyptians. Moreover the man Moses was very great in the land of Egypt, in the sight of Pharaoh’s servants and in the sight of the people.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"gave","s":["H5414"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"favor","s":["H2580"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"sight","s":["H5869"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Egyptians","s":["H4714"],"a":[13]},{"t":". Moreover the "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[9]},{"t":" was "},{"t":"very","s":["H3966"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[10]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"]},{"t":", in the "},{"t":"sight","s":["H5869"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Pharaoh’s","s":["H6547"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"servants","s":["H5650"],"a":[15]},{"t":" and in the "},{"t":"sight","s":["H5869"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And Moses said, Thus says Jehovah, About midnight I will go out into the midst of Egypt,","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":", About "},{"t":"midnight","s":["H3915"],"a":[6]},{"t":" I will go "},{"t":"out","s":["H3318"],"a":[8]},{"t":" into the "},{"t":"midst","s":["H8432"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[10]},{"t":","}]},{"n":5,"text":"And all the firstborn in the land of Egypt shall die, from the firstborn of Pharaoh who sits upon his throne to the firstborn of the female slave who is behind the millstones, and all the firstborn of cattle.","tok":[{"t":"And all the "},{"t":"firstborn","s":["H1060"],"a":[2]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[4]},{"t":" shall "},{"t":"die","s":["H4191"],"a":[0]},{"t":", from the "},{"t":"firstborn","s":["H1060"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[6]},{"t":" who sits upon his "},{"t":"throne","s":["H3678"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"firstborn","s":["H1060"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of the female slave who is "},{"t":"behind","s":["H0310"],"a":[14]},{"t":" the millstones, and all the "},{"t":"firstborn","s":["H1060"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"cattle","s":["H0929"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"And there shall be a great cry throughout all the land of Egypt, such as has not been or ever will be again.","tok":[{"t":"And there shall "},{"t":"be","s":["H1961"],"a":[0]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cry","s":["H6818"],"a":[1]},{"t":" throughout all the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[5]},{"t":", such as has not been or ever will be again."}]},{"n":7,"text":"But a dog shall not bark at any of the children of Israel, at man or beast, that you may know that Jehovah makes a distinction between the Egyptians and Israel.","tok":[{"t":"But a "},{"t":"dog","s":["H3611"],"a":[5]},{"t":" shall not bark at any of the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[2]},{"t":", at "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[7]},{"t":" or "},{"t":"beast","s":["H0929"],"a":[9]},{"t":", that you may "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[11]},{"t":" that "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[14]},{"t":" makes a distinction between the "},{"t":"Egyptians","s":["H4714"],"a":[16]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"And all these servants of yours shall come down to me and bow down to me, saying, Get out, you and all the people who follow you; and after that I will go out. And he went out from Pharaoh in hot anger.","tok":[{"t":"And all these "},{"t":"servants","s":["H5650"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of yours shall come "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to me and bow "},{"t":"down","s":["H7812"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to me, "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[7]},{"t":", Get "},{"t":"out","s":["H3318"],"a":[8]},{"t":", you and all the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[11]},{"t":" who "},{"t":"follow","s":["H7272"],"a":[13]},{"t":" you; and "},{"t":"after","s":["H0310"],"a":[14]},{"t":" that I will go "},{"t":"out","s":["H3318"],"a":[16]},{"t":". And he went "},{"t":"out","s":["H3318"],"a":[17]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[19]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"hot","s":["H2750"],"a":[20]},{"t":" "},{"t":"anger","s":["H0639"],"a":[21]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Then Jehovah said to Moses, Pharaoh will not listen to you, in order that My wonders may be multiplied in the land of Egypt.","tok":[{"t":"Then "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[7]},{"t":" will not "},{"t":"listen","s":["H8085"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to you, in order that My "},{"t":"wonders","s":["H4159"],"a":[10]},{"t":" may be "},{"t":"multiplied","s":["H7235"],"a":[9]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Thus Moses and Aaron did all these wonders before Pharaoh, but Jehovah hardened Pharaoh’s heart, and he did not let the children of Israel go out of his land.","tok":[{"t":"Thus "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Aaron","s":["H0175"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"did","s":["H6213"],"a":[2]},{"t":" all these "},{"t":"wonders","s":["H4159"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[8]},{"t":", but "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"hardened","s":["H2388"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Pharaoh’s","s":["H6547"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[12]},{"t":", and he did not let the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[18]},{"t":" go "},{"t":"out","s":["H7971"],"a":[15]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]}]}
